    {
      "url": "https://www.bg-wiki.com/index.php?title=Community_Dark_Knight_Guide&oldid=770942",
      "title": "Community DRK guide permanent revision770942",
      "locator": "Rendered header00:12,1July2026,Brahmsz; weapon options,TP/hybrid,WS,casting and utility sections",
      "findings": [
        "Opinion guide with mixed-era examples, not a latestBiS certification. No universal DT/TP build.",
        "Montante+1 is a listed greatsword option. Scythe/GS and alternative stage contexts stay distinct.",
        "Absorb section explicitly unfinished. FC example leaves waist and main/sub unspecified; not a full loadout or cap proof.",
        "Entropy third cape mixes STR/INT/WSD and legs prose disagrees with grid. Nexus INT/DA alternative is independently attributed.",
        "DrainII/III HP boost, missingHP recovery and DSNV duration/merits are separate; source numerical maxima not adopted.",
        "DreadSpikes labels I/II/III are gear examples, not three learned spells. Ratri pieces increase damage taken; source HP sum and survival not certified.",
        "ScarletDelirium damage-taking grids are situational, not defensive idle; not selected."
      ],
      "observation_sha256": "bff0259e75882f076899b2a157745c2fb1cf796eb69a4a8113920fecc29c471e"
