    {
      "url": "https://www.ffxiah.com/node/52",
      "title": "Quetzacoatl historical DRK guide",
      "locator": "Original ordinaryChrome read; footer2017-05-18; JA,trait,magic and merit contexts only",
      "findings": [
        "Historical discovery only, not current gear rankings or capped JA/trait totals.",
        "LastResort activation and sustained DesperateBlows with a twohand weapon require actual buff/merits; /SAM Hasso is not automatic.",
        "Souleater consumes HP during attacks; StalwartSoul mitigation not a no-cost assumption.",
        "DrainIII/EndarkII require actual gifts; DarkSeal actual merit access; actual MP/recast and target required.",
        "AbsorbTP depends on enemy usableTP; Aspir depends on target MP. HP recovery and MP recovery not interchangeable."
